        <mxCell id="call_119" value="7. SQS invokes Threshold Lambda (batch size 10, reserved concurrency 10, ASM-162)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;strokeColor=#d69e2e;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1090" y="1310" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1640" y="1310" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="call_120" value="8. Strongly consistent GetItem from telemetry table: ensures record is persisted before evaluation (ASM-161)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;strokeColor=#319795;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1640" y="1370" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="810" y="1370" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="call_121" value="9. Query active Federation threshold version at original_timestamp (sort key effective_from &amp;lt;= ts, KMS &#x27;records&#x27;)&#10;Resolves farm-specific override if present, else pilot rule (ASM-138) | Zero cache (sec 4.4)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;endArrow=open;endSize=8;strokeColor=#d69e2e;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1640" y="1445" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1370" y="1445" as="targetPoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-195" y="-4" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_step10" value="10. Classify reading: in_range, below, above, closure_reached (sec 5)&#10;Compare against active bounds (e.g., Soil Temp 14-30 °C, Coffee Moisture 12%)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#d69e2e;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1a202c;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1390" y="1485" width="520" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="call_122" value="11. Episode Deduplication &amp; Update in Alert Store (TransactWriteItems, KMS &#x27;records&#x27;, 5y TTL):&#10;• First out-of-range: conditional put opens Episode; emits crop_alert_raised (triggers ADR-002 pest case for drone)&#10;• Subsequent out-of-range: attaches to open episode (updates reading count &amp; extremes; suppresses duplicate alert)&#10;• In-range reading: closes episode (alert_resolved) | Drying 12%: emits single drying_closure_notice per lot" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1660" y="1655" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1940" y="1655" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="call_123" value="12. Publish alert event to SNS Alert Topic (episode_id, farm_alias, node_id, var, val, range, version, delayed_flag)&#10;Note: No PII/names/phones in SNS message (sec 7.3) | Async Bedrock Nova Pro plausibility check (ASM-167)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1660" y="1728" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="1940" y="1728" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hdr_hop6" value="HOP 6 (Target: 30 s) | NOTIFICATION DISPATCHER: PII RESOLUTION &amp; SMS COALESCING" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#feebc8;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#7b341e;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1820" y="1765" width="780" height="28" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="act_124" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#feebc8;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1940" y="1828" width="20" height="28" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="act_125" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#feebc8;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2240" y="1828" width="20" height="198" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="call_127" value="13. Fanout: SNS Alert Topic delivers message to SQS Notification Queue (with DLQ)" style="html=1;verticalAlign=bottom;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;dashed=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=9;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a202c;fontStyle=0;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;spacingTop=4;" edge="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="1960" y="1835" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="2240" y="1835" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_step14" value="14. Dispatcher resolves farmer identity &amp; queries DynamoDB personal-data table (KMS &#x27;personal&#x27;)&#10;Retrieves phone number &amp; push endpoint token&#10;Strict PII isolation: Threshold Lambda never sees PII" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1a202c;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1975" y="1868" width="550" height="72" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card_step15" value="15. SMS coalescing logic (ASM-135): First SMS sent immediately;&#10;further alert openings for same farm within 10 min combined into follow-up SMS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1a202c;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1975" y="1956" width="550" height="56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="hdr_hop7" value="HOP 7 (Target: 60 s) | MULTI-CHANNEL DELIVERY: PUSH &amp; SMS DISPATCH TO FARMER PHONE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#edf2f7;strokeColor=#4a5568;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#1a202c;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2220" y="2035" width="780" height="28" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="act_128" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#feebc8;strokeColor=#dd6b20;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
